CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/k/d com/corrodinggames/rts/gameFramework/path/FastNodeQueue
	COMMENT FastNodeQueue - the original (non-default) A* open list, a hybrid "array cache + overflow heap": buffer (PathOpenListNode[975]) caches the nodes near the best score, overflowQueue (java.util.PriorityQueue) holds the rest. Fields: bufferLastIndex (last used slot in buffer), lowestBufferIndex/lowestBufferScore (best score currently in the buffer), highestBufferIndex/highestBufferScore (worst score in the buffer), lowestQueueScore (score at the head of overflowQueue), consecutiveDrainCount/maxConsecutiveDrainCount (statistics for how long c() had to rescan), and the static profiling counters maxBufferCount, maxQueueSize, totalAddCount, drainCount, sameScoreDrainCount, scoreChangeCount, statTimer1/statTimer2. This class is kept for reference/debugging - FastNodeQueue2 is the one actually used by PathOpenList. Two unused fields remain obfuscated. [field names derived from this class' logic]
